        "lessons": [
          {
            "title": "Lesson #1",
            "id": 145253,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>¿Cuándo podemos usar <code>console.log()</code> para mostrar el valor de una variable de juego?</p><selection multiple=\"multiple\"><item correct=\"true\" value=\"1\">Después de que creemos la variable</item><item correct=\"false\" value=\"2\">Antes de que creemos la variable</item><item correct=\"false\" value=\"2\">Antes o después de que creemos la variable</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Después de que creemos la variable.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #2",
            "id": 145254,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>¿Por qué esto no es un valor de cadena?</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><content><text value=\"Boss Level\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Porque no hay comillas dobles alrededor</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Porque hay un espacio entre las palabras</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Porque las palabras están en mayúsculas</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Porque no hay comillas dobles alrededor.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #3",
            "id": 145255,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Código el signo <code>=</code> para darle a la variable <code>playerShip</code> el valor de cadena <code>\"Falcon\"</code>.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" startIndex=\"17\" endIndex=\"18\" isDefault=\"true\" /></interactions><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" playerShip = \" /><text value=\"&quot;Falcon&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";}\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Asegúrese de elegir <code>=</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #4",
            "id": 145256,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Muestra <code>Game Over</code> en la consola.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"Game Over\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"0\" endIndex=\"11\" /><option startIndex=\"11\" endIndex=\"12\" /><option startIndex=\"12\" endIndex=\"23\" /><option startIndex=\"23\" endIndex=\"24\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Game Over&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Asegúrese de elegir <code>console.log</code> seguido de <code>(</code> y luego <code>\"Game Over\"</code>, <code>)</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #5",
            "id": 145257,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Muestra el valor de la cadena en la consola.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"display\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"52\" endIndex=\"63\" /><option startIndex=\"63\" endIndex=\"64\" /><option startIndex=\"64\" endIndex=\"71\" /><option startIndex=\"71\" endIndex=\"72\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" powerUp = \" /><text value=\"&quot;Shield, Speed, and Double Damage&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(powerUp);\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Asegúrese de elegir <code>console.log</code> seguido de <code>(</code> y luego <code>powerUp</code>, <code>)</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #6",
            "id": 145258,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>¿Qué muestra este código en la consola?</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><content><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" playerHealth = \" /><text value=\"1400\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" playerShield = \" /><text value=\"900\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"playerShield = \" /><text value=\"1000\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"playerHealth = \" /><text value=\"1500\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(playerShield);\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>1000</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>1500</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>900</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Asegúrese de elegir <code>1000</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #7",
            "id": 145259,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Muestra <code>maxEnemies</code> menos <code>enemiesDefeated</code> en la consola.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"/\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"93\" endIndex=\"103\" /><option startIndex=\"104\" endIndex=\"105\" /><option startIndex=\"106\" endIndex=\"121\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" maxEnemies = \" /><text value=\"5\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" enemiesDefeated = \" /><text value=\"3\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Enemies left: &quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(maxEnemies - enemiesDefeated);\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Asegúrese de elegir <code>maxEnemies</code> seguido de <code>-</code> y finalmente <code>enemiesDefeated</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #8",
            "id": 145260,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Muestra el valor de <code>totalScore</code> en la consola.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" startIndex=\"106\" endIndex=\"116\" isDefault=\"true\" /></interactions><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" baseScore = \" /><text value=\"1084\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" bonusPoints = \" /><text value=\"500\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" totalScore = baseScore + bonusPoints;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(totalScore);}\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Asegúrese de elegir <code>totalScore</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #9",
            "id": 145261,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Establece <code>totalScore</code> al resultado de <code>score</code> menos <code>deathPenalty</code>.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"+\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"66\" endIndex=\"71\" /><option startIndex=\"72\" endIndex=\"73\" /><option startIndex=\"74\" endIndex=\"86\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" score = \" /><text value=\"1084\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" deathPenalty = \" /><text value=\"500\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" totalScore = score - deathPenalty;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(totalScore);\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Asegúrese de elegir <code>score</code> seguido de <code>-</code> y finalmente <code>deathPenalty</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #10",
            "id": 145262,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>¿Cuál es el valor de <code>finalHealth</code>?</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" damage = \" /><text value=\"3\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" extraDamage = \" /><text value=\"4\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" finalHealth = \" /><text value=\"10\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"finalHealth = damage + extraDamage;\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>7</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>10</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>4</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Asegúrese de elegir <code>7</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #11",
            "id": 145263,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>¿Qué signo convierte <code>true</code> en <code>false</code>?</p><selection multiple=\"multiple\" iscode=\"false\"><item correct=\"true\" value=\"1\"><code>!</code></item><item correct=\"false\" value=\"2\"><code>-</code></item><item correct=\"false\" value=\"2\"><code>?</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Asegúrese de elegir <code>!</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #12",
            "id": 145264,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>¿Cuál valor no es una cadena?</p><selection multiple=\"multiple\" iscode=\"false\"><item correct=\"true\" value=\"1\"><code>true</code></item><item correct=\"false\" value=\"2\"><code>\"true\"</code></item><item correct=\"false\" value=\"2\"><code>\"pause\"</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Asegúrese de elegir <code>true</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #13",
            "id": 145265,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>¿Puedes asegurarte de que <code>true</code> aparezca en la consola?</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"!true\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"false\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"127\" endIndex=\"135\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" isPaused = \" /><text value=\"false\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Paused:&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(isPaused);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"isPaused = !\" /><text value=\"false\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Paused:&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(isPaused);\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Asegúrese de elegir <code>isPaused</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #14",
            "id": 145266,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Usa el signo especial para negar el valor.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&quot;\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\";\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"15\" endIndex=\"16\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" hasKey = !\" /><text value=\"true\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\";\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Asegúrese de elegir <code>!</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #15",
            "id": 145267,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>¿Puedes elegir el fragmento que muestra <code>true</code> en la consola?</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"false\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"91\" endIndex=\"95\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" splitLoot = \" /><text value=\"15\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\" / \" /><text value=\"5\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(splitLoot);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Fair split:&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"true\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\");\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Asegúrese de elegir <code>true</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #16",
            "id": 145268,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>¿Qué produce el uso del operador <code>===</code>?</p><selection multiple=\"multiple\"><item correct=\"true\" value=\"1\">Un valor de <code>true</code> o <code>false</code></item><item correct=\"false\" value=\"2\">Un valor de <code>\"true\"</code> o <code>\"false\"</code></item><item correct=\"false\" value=\"2\">Un valor numérico</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Un valor de <code>true</code> o <code>false</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #17",
            "id": 145269,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Comprueba si <code>coins</code> es igual al valor <code>100</code>.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"var\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"36\" endIndex=\"39\" /><option startIndex=\"40\" endIndex=\"43\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" coins = \" /><text value=\"15\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(coins === \" /><text value=\"100\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\");\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Asegúrese de elegir <code>===</code> seguido de <code>100</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #18",
            "id": 145270,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>¿Qué mostrará este código en la consola?</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><content><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"906\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\" === \" /><text value=\"9006\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\");\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>false</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>true</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>9069006</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Asegúrese de elegir <code>false</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #19",
            "id": 145271,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Haz que el resultado de la comparación sea <code>true</code>.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&lt;\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"49\" endIndex=\"52\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" enemiesAlive = \" /><text value=\"3\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(enemiesAlive !== \" /><text value=\"0\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\");\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Asegúrese de elegir <code>!==</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #20",
            "id": 145272,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Comprueba si el número elegido no es igual a <code>0</code>.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"==\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"37\" endIndex=\"38\" /><option startIndex=\"51\" endIndex=\"52\" /><option startIndex=\"55\" endIndex=\"56\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" chosenLevel = \" /><text value=\"3\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" notZero = chosenLevel !== \" /><text value=\"0\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(notZero);\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Asegúrese de elegir <code>=</code> seguido de <code>!</code> y finalmente <code>0</code>.</p></body></html>"
